WEBVTT

00:00.020 --> 00:01.630
Twenty-two years on the floor.

00:01.880 --> 00:04.950
Then I started building what an officer can actually hold.

00:05.340 --> 00:07.750
This is the RJC First Shift app.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.510
Thumb through it. Home. The next meeting. Pay. Grievance prep.

00:12.800 --> 00:17.340
Built for that shift. Independent.
Not a county system. Not a guild endorsement.

00:17.680 --> 00:20.330
Now the written report. The facts go in.

00:20.460 --> 00:24.470
The issue. The hours. Who got called.
The statement. The evidence.

00:24.850 --> 00:29.050
Then it is a page you can thumb.
Voluntary overtime, skipped.

00:29.270 --> 00:33.770
Lowest hours. Not called. Prep only.
Not a filed grievance.

00:33.950 --> 00:36.100
Prepared for review by the shift rep.

00:36.450 --> 00:41.420
Pay you can check. Overtime that follows the contract.
A report you can read.

00:41.750 --> 00:45.310
Parallax builds for officers.
Things that work on the floor.

00:45.550 --> 00:46.710
This is Parallax.
